<title>USA: ACNielsen Corp Q3 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>ACNielsen Corp Q3 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.39     loss	 $0.59</p>
<p> Net profit		21,900     loss	33,100</p>
<p> Oper rev		 346,700		  321,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  56,700		   56,500</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.08     loss	 $1.24</p>
<p> Net profit		 4,400     loss	69,900</p>
<p> Oper rev		 991,000		  932,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  56,700		   56,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1995 Q3 includes after-tax charge of $24.2 million, or $0.43 per share, from severance plan</p>
<p>1996 Q3 profit includes $13.6 million tax benefit, reflecting a reduced tax rate to 48 percent for the nine month period ended September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
